title DoIP Server - Module Structure

top to bottom direction

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

skinparam dpi 180
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam packageFontSize 18
skinparam componentFontSize 15
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 70

package "Application" #FFF8DC {
    component "main.rs\nstartup + wiring" as MAIN #FFF2CC
}

package "Library API" #FFF8DC {
    component "lib.rs\nexports: config, doip, proxy, server, error" as LIB #FFE599
}

package "Core Modules" {
    component "config\nConfigProvider + providers\nServerConfig/TcpConfig/UdpConfig/EcuConfig" as CONFIG #D9EAD3
    component "server\nTransport runtime\nServer + tcp + udp" as SERVER #CFE2F3
    component "doip\nISO 13400-2 protocol\nheader + dispatch + handlers" as DOIP #CFE2F3
    component "proxy\nSovdProxy + StubProxy" as PROXY #D9D2E9
    component "error\nAppError / protocol/config/proxy errors" as ERROR #E6E6E6
}


MAIN --> LIB : uses crate API

LIB --> CONFIG 
LIB --> SERVER 
LIB --> DOIP 
LIB --> PROXY 
LIB --> ERROR 

SERVER --> CONFIG : consumes runtime config
SERVER --> DOIP : uses dispatchers + handlers
DOIP --> PROXY : diagnostics via SovdProxy

CONFIG ..> ERROR : ConfigError
SERVER ..> ERROR : ServerError
DOIP ..> ERROR : DoipError
PROXY ..> ERROR : SovdProxyError



@enduml
